Problem: many people encorporate workouts into their everyday lives, however often times they:
  Don't know if their form is correct
  Don't consistently track workouts to promote progressive overload
  Don't know how or when to progressively overload safely
  Don't have access to a personal trainer

Solution: Build an ai powered fitness app that uses the web cam to complete the following:
  Count reps
  Analyze form
  Track workout overtime
  Recommend increase in weight in order to progressively overload

Goals for the future: 
  Create an app that allows people to meet their fitness goals while minimizing injuries

Target Audience:
  Highschool/College students and overall beganeners to the gym - usually starting in the gym and standardizing form will minimize injury and the app will help progress faster
  Personal trainers: Allows them to easily collect data about the users form

Version 1 (prototype):
  will use ai and the users webcame to detect the users form 
  count reps
  limited to few exercises such as sqauts

Version 2:
  add more standard exercises to expand the app
